    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused about that last part. How would Swedish rules apply if the assets are in Spain and the US? And regarding the \"global estate\"—does the UK government actually see those foreign assets at all, or are there ways they might go unnoticed unless specifically declared? I'm trying to understand the risk of \"hidden\" liabilities here.",
